========================================
Search mov <anything>, ebx for instance:

--- mov\s+.+\s*,\s*ebx ---

result:
mov dword [eax+0x1C], ebx
mov dword [esi], ebx
mov dword [esp+0x10], ebx
mov edx, ebx
....
========================================
search for push eax ; <anything not pop> ; pop anything ; anything ; ret

push\s+eax\s*;\s*(?!pop\b)[^;]+\s*;\s*pop\s+[^;]+(?:\s*;\s*pop\s+[^;]+)*\s*;\s*ret

also more simple:
push\s+eax\s*;(?:\s*[^;]+;)*\s*pop\s+[^;]+
